{"kp_id": "zj-026.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-026", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "公孙通冲脉、气脉强，腹胀等可用；为络穴，虚实补泻皆可。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp4", "meridian.tv", "concept.luo_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-026.c01", "evidence_quote": "腹胀、肚子骨胀啊，什么通通可以用公孙", "seg_from": 6, "seg_to": 11, "start_s": 23.01, "end_s": 50.605, "citation": {"youtube_id": "VTXyFZZv064", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTXyFZZv064&t=23s", "series": "zj", "episode": 26, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 26", "start_s": 23.01, "end_s": 50.6}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-026.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-026", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "商丘在内踝骨交接缝中，直刺；为脾经经穴。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp5", "meridian.sp"], "chapter_id": "zj-026.c01", "evidence_quote": "交接的缝里面，叫做商丘", "seg_from": 19, "seg_to": 25, "start_s": 86.8, "end_s": 126.275, "citation": {"youtube_id": "VTXyFZZv064", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTXyFZZv064&t=86s", "series": "zj", "episode": 26, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 26", "start_s": 86.8, "end_s": 126.28}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-026.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-026", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "痛多酸少宜先泻后补；酸多痛少宜先补后泻。痛较易除，麻需更多次治疗。", "entity_ids": ["method.bu_xie"], "chapter_id": "zj-026.c01", "evidence_quote": "痛比较多，酸比较少，就是先泻后补", "seg_from": 36, "seg_to": 39, "start_s": 180.49, "end_s": 207.91, "citation": {"youtube_id": "VTXyFZZv064", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTXyFZZv064&t=180s", "series": "zj", "episode": 26, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 26", "start_s": 180.49, "end_s": 207.91}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-026.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-026", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "三阴交为足三阴（脾、肝、肾）交会处，与足三里同为大穴；勿太贴骨下针。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp6", "meridian.sp", "meridian.lr", "meridian.ki"], "chapter_id": "zj-026.c02", "evidence_quote": "三条阴经都交汇在这里", "seg_from": 74, "seg_to": 88, "start_s": 370.35, "end_s": 460.865, "citation": {"youtube_id": "VTXyFZZv064", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTXyFZZv064&t=370s", "series": "zj", "episode": 26, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 26", "start_s": 370.35, "end_s": 460.87}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-026.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-026", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "三阴交可诊治痛经等：按压痛程度反映病情；愈后按之不痛可确认。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp6"], "chapter_id": "zj-026.c02", "evidence_quote": "按按三阴交就知道一按那个他惨叫一声", "seg_from": 96, "seg_to": 113, "start_s": 482.51, "end_s": 596.975, "citation": {"youtube_id": "VTXyFZZv064", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTXyFZZv064&t=482s", "series": "zj", "episode": 26, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 26", "start_s": 482.51, "end_s": 596.98}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-026.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-026", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "孕妇一般禁针合谷与三阴交：补合谷易气旺、泻三阴交易耗血，补泻一错有堕胎之虞。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li4", "acupoint.sp6"], "chapter_id": "zj-026.c02", "evidence_quote": "合谷、三阴交不要下，免得你补泻搞错", "seg_from": 155, "seg_to": 157, "start_s": 783.8, "end_s": 801.605, "citation": {"youtube_id": "VTXyFZZv064", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTXyFZZv064&t=783s", "series": "zj", "episode": 26, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 26", "start_s": 783.8, "end_s": 801.61}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "竞争=禁针；摔掉=衰掉", "source": "llm_read"}
